    "description": {
      "content": "The fatsecret Platform API provides programmatic access to a global food nutrition database covering more than 1.9 million verified food items across 56 countries. It supports food and recipe search, barcode scanning, image recognition, natural language processing, and full profile-based food diary, exercise diary, and weight tracking management.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: fatsecret Platform",
